data: {"item_id":"rs_347254","output_index":0,"sequence_number":278,"summary_index":0,"text":"We need to implement task 001. The previous attempt failed due to malformed tool call. We need to edit files appropriately using apply_patch tool.\n\nWe need to create a Node.js server using built-in http, sqlite (node:sqlite). Provide endpoints: GET /, GET /health, POST /projects to create, GET /projects list, GET /projects/:id page.\n\nAlso serve static frontend files (HTML/JS/CSS). Simpler: serve a single index.html that contains UI for listing and creating projects, and client-side JS to fetch API.\n\nBut we need navigation: clicking Open project navigates to /projects/\u003cid\u003e which should serve a page showing project name heading, Projects button linking back.\n\nSimplify: server serves two HTML files: index.html for list, project.html for individual.\n\nImplement server.js with http server, parse URL, serve static files from a public folder.\n\nImplement database init: use node:sqlite open with DB_PATH env var.\n\nImplement API: GET /api/projects to list; POST /api/projects to create; GET /api/projects/:id to get one.\n\nBut spec expects endpoints maybe at /projects? Not specified, but can use these.\n\nFrontend uses fetch.\n\nImplement health endpoint GET /health returns JSON.\n\nPackage.json scripts: start runs node server.js.\n\nWe must commit all files.\n\nLet's check repository current state.","type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done"}

